sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as Platform Operator
    participant Container as odh-mlmd-grpc-server<br/>UBI9 Container
    participant Server as metadata_store_server<br/>gRPC Binary
    participant DB as Database Backend<br/>(MySQL/PostgreSQL)
    participant Client as ML Pipeline Client<br/>(Python MetadataStore)

    Note over Container,Server: Startup Sequence

    Operator->>Container: Deploy container
    Container->>Server: Start with CLI flags<br/>--grpc_port=8080<br/>--metadata_source_config_type

    Server->>DB: Initialize schema<br/>(retry up to N attempts)
    alt Schema upgrade enabled
        Server->>DB: Run schema migration<br/>(--enable_database_upgrade)
    end
    DB-->>Server: Schema ready

    Server->>Server: Start gRPC server<br/>(insecure or SSL credentials)

    Note over Client,DB: Runtime - Metadata CRUD Operations

    Client->>Server: gRPC/8080: PutArtifactType<br/>(register ML artifact types)
    Server->>DB: INSERT artifact_type
    DB-->>Server: OK
    Server-->>Client: PutArtifactTypeResponse

    Client->>Server: gRPC/8080: PutExecution<br/>(record pipeline step execution)
    Server->>DB: INSERT execution
    DB-->>Server: OK
    Server-->>Client: PutExecutionResponse

    Client->>Server: gRPC/8080: PutArtifacts<br/>(record model artifacts)
    Server->>DB: INSERT artifacts
    DB-->>Server: OK
    Server-->>Client: PutArtifactsResponse

    Client->>Server: gRPC/8080: PutEvents<br/>(link artifacts to executions)
    Server->>DB: INSERT events
    DB-->>Server: OK
    Server-->>Client: PutEventsResponse

    Note over Client,DB: Runtime - Lineage Queries

    Client->>Server: gRPC/8080: GetLineageSubgraph<br/>(trace artifact provenance)
    Server->>DB: SELECT lineage graph<br/>(recursive joins)
    DB-->>Server: Lineage data
    Server-->>Client: LineageSubgraph response

    Client->>Server: gRPC/8080: GetArtifactsByContext<br/>(find artifacts in pipeline run)
    Server->>DB: SELECT artifacts<br/>WHERE context_id = ?
    DB-->>Server: Artifact records
    Server-->>Client: GetArtifactsResponse
